1
00:00:00,959 --> 00:00:02,419
What the hell
is wrong with you?

2
00:00:02,419 --> 00:00:04,004
See?

3
00:00:04,004 --> 00:00:05,714
He still can't push me away.

4
00:00:05,714 --> 00:00:07,632
Don't believe a word
he says, Seung-hyun.

5
00:00:07,632 --> 00:00:09,426
Liar.

6
00:00:10,468 --> 00:00:12,345
I hurt him

7
00:00:12,345 --> 00:00:15,348
and yet you still
can't walk away from me.

8
00:00:15,849 --> 00:00:17,681
You hurt Seung-hyun.

9
00:00:19,561 --> 00:00:21,409
And I've had enough.

10
00:00:22,672 --> 00:00:24,340
What, so you're...

11
00:00:24,341 --> 00:00:26,343
Jeong-min

12
00:00:30,822 --> 00:00:33,616
I think it's really over now.

13
00:00:39,889 --> 00:00:41,474
No, don't do this.

14
00:00:41,556 --> 00:00:42,849
Let's go, Seung-hyun.

15
00:00:43,769 --> 00:00:45,771
There's no reason to stay.

16
00:00:45,772 --> 00:00:48,274
Ji-sung!

17
00:00:48,275 --> 00:00:50,945
No, don't leave me here.

18
00:00:51,073 --> 00:00:55,077
Ji-sung!
